    <node id="BREAST EXAM">
      <data key="d0">BREAST EXAM</data>
      <data key="d1">BREAST EXAM</data>
      <data key="d2">endpoint</data>
      <data key="d3">A breast exam is a component of a physical examination that specifically checks the breasts for abnormalities. It is a physical exam that helps find breast cancer at its earliest, most treatable stages. Thus, the breast exam serves both as a general assessment of breast health and as a screening tool for early cancer detection.
Relationships:
