  - Target: HPV VACCINATION
  - Description: The HPV vaccine prevents new HPV infections.
  - Source: UNITED STATES
  - Target: HPV VACCINATION
  - Description: The 9-strain HPV vaccine is available in the United States and vaccination is an option for adults aged 45 and under.</data>
