    <node id="VAPING">
      <data key="d0">VAPING</data>
      <data key="d1">VAPING</data>
      <data key="d2">extracted</data>
      <data key="d3">Vaping is the use of e-cigarettes. Vaping nicotine increases cancer risk, can limit how well cancer treatment works, and increases surgical side effects. For these reasons, the advice is to quit vaping.
