  - Source: VAPING
  - Target: SURGERY
  - Description: Vaping greatly increases the chance of side effects during and after surgery.
  - Source: VAPING
  - Target: SMOKEFREE.GOV
  - Description: SmokeFree.gov is also recommended as support for people who vape
  - Source: VAPING
  - Target: BETOBACCOFREE.GOV
  - Description: BeTobaccoFree.gov is also recommended as support for people who vape
