    <node id="SMOKING OR VAPING">
      <data key="d0">SMOKING OR VAPING</data>
      <data key="d1">SMOKING OR VAPING</data>
      <data key="d2">extracted</data>
      <data key="d3">Smoking or vaping nicotine increases cancer risk, can limit treatment effectiveness and wound healing, and increases side effects during and after surgery.
Relationships:
