      <data key="d1">LABORATORY</data>
      <data key="d2">endpoint</data>
      <data key="d3">A facility where biopsy tissue samples are sent for analysis; the neuropathologist works with the laboratory to perform lab testing.
Relationships:
  - Source: NEUROPATHOLOGIST
  - Target: LABORATORY
  - Description: The neuropathologist works in association with the laboratory to examine biopsy samples.</data>
    </node>
