    <node id="SQUAMOUS CELL SKIN CANCER">
      <data key="d0">SQUAMOUS CELL SKIN CANCER</data>
      <data key="d1">SQUAMOUS CELL SKIN CANCER</data>
      <data key="d2">endpoint</data>
      <data key="d3">Squamous cell skin cancer is a cancer that arises in the squamous cells of the skin. It is recognized as a type of skin cancer, and the NCCN Guidelines for Patients provides treatment information specifically for cutaneous squamous cell carcinoma, including cases affecting the vermilion lip. Readers are directed to these NCCN patient guidelines for more detailed information on the condition.
Relationships:
  - Source: SQUAMOUS CELL SKIN CANCER
  - Target: BASAL CELL SKIN CANCER
  - Description: Both are types of skin cancer; the text contrasts basal cell skin cancer with squamous cell skin cancer and directs readers to NCCN for more information
  - Source: NCCN
  - Target: SQUAMOUS CELL SKIN CANCER
  - Description: The National Comprehensive Cancer Network (NCCN) provides patient-friendly guidelines for squamous cell skin cancer. These guidelines are accessible through the NCCN website at NCCN.org/patientguidelines and through the NCCN Patient Guides for Cancer mobile application. The materials direct readers to the NCCN Guidelines for Patients as a comprehensive source of information on squamous cell skin cancer, offering guidance on diagnosis, treatment, and supportive care. The NCCN thus serves as a key resource for patients seeking reliable, expert-reviewed information about this condition.
  - Source: SQUAMOUS CELL SKIN CANCER
  - Target: MELANOMA
  - Description: Both are types of skin cancer mentioned together as topics covered by NCCN patient materials
  - Source: SQUAMOUS CELL SKIN CANCER
  - Target: SKIN CANCER
  - Description: Squamous cell skin cancer is mentioned as a type of skin cancer
  - Source: SQUAMOUS CELL SKIN CANCER
  - Target: CANCER
  - Description: Squamous cell skin cancer is a type of cancer.
  - Source: SQUAMOUS CELL CARCINOMA
  - Target: SQUAMOUS CELL SKIN CANCER
  - Description: Squamous cell skin cancer is a type of squamous cell carcinoma.
  - Source: CUTANEOUS SQUAMOUS CELL CARCINOMA OF THE VERMILION LIP
  - Target: SQUAMOUS CELL SKIN CANCER
  - Description: Cutaneous squamous cell carcinoma of the vermilion lip is a form of squamous cell skin cancer.</data>
    </node>
