    <node id="SURGEON">
      <data key="d0">SURGEON</data>
      <data key="d1">SURGEON</data>
      <data key="d2">extracted</data>
      <data key="d3">SURGEON is a medical professional who specializes in performing surgical procedures. As a physician, the surgeon may also provide cancer genetics counseling and perform diagnostic procedures such as skin biopsies. In the context of cancer care, the surgeon is skilled in identifying and locating sentinel lymph nodes, which are key to determining whether cancer has spread. Thus, the surgeon’s role combines operative expertise with diagnostic and counseling responsibilities in patient care.
Relationships:
  - Source: SURGERY
  - Target: SURGEON
  - Description: A surgeon performs surgery.
  - Source: SENTINEL LYMPH NODE BIOPSY
  - Target: SURGEON
  - Description: A surgeon finds and removes sentinel lymph nodes during sentinel lymph node biopsy.
  - Source: NCCN
  - Target: SURGEON
  - Description: NCCN recommends that patients at genetic risk of skin cancer receive counseling from specialists such as surgeons.</data>
      <data key="d4">1</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">ENTITY: SURGEON
Description: SURGEON is a medical professional who specializes in performing surgical procedures. As a physician, the surgeon may also provide cancer genetics counseling and perform diagnostic procedures such as skin biopsies. In the context of cancer care, the surgeon is skilled in identifying and locating sentinel lymph nodes, which are key to determining whether cancer has spread. Thus, the surgeon’s role combines operative expertise with diagnostic and counseling responsibilities in patient care.
Relationships:
  - Source: SURGERY
  - Target: SURGEON
  - Description: A surgeon performs surgery.
  - Source: SENTINEL LYMPH NODE BIOPSY
  - Target: SURGEON
  - Description: A surgeon finds and removes sentinel lymph nodes during sentinel lymph node biopsy.
  - Source: NCCN
