      <data key="d2">extracted</data>
      <data key="d3">MSI-H/dMMR mutation is a type of DNA change that leads to microsatellite instability-high or deficient mismatch repair. Microsatellite instability is a characteristic feature of MSI-H/dMMR mutation. In other words, the MSI-H/dMMR mutation drives the development of microsatellite instability, making the two closely related in the context of genomic alterations.</data>
