Description: STAGE 1A CERVICAL CANCER is an early stage of cervical cancer in which the cancer is 5 millimeters or smaller in size. This stage represents a very early form of the disease, with the tumor limited to the cervix and measuring no more than 5 mm in greatest dimension.
