      <data key="d10">1.0</data>
      <data key="d11">Burkitt leukemia is mature B-cell ALL, a rare form whose treatment differs from standard B-ALL. Burkitt leukemia, also called mature B-cell ALL, is treated differently from standard B-ALL.</data>
