      <data key="d9">related_to</data>
      <data key="d10">1.0</data>
      <data key="d11">The U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) is a federal agency of the United States. It operates within the United States as a U.S. federal agency, fulfilling its regulatory and public health responsibilities under the authority of the U.S. government.</data>
      <data key="d12">UNITED STATES</data>
    </edge>
