      <data key="d11">The FDA, or the U.S. Food and Drug Administration, is a federal agency of the United States. It serves as a U.S. regulatory agency responsible for approving cancer treatments, among its broader public health regulatory duties.</data>
      <data key="d12">UNITED STATES</data>
    </edge>
